  "notes": "Phanpy (Mastodon client) notifications page. Grouped notifications: colored line icons in a left gutter (purple rocket = boost, orange heart = like, grey person = follow, orange speech bubble = mention, bell = new post, pencil = edit), bold 'N people' summaries, and a row of gradient initial-avatars each with a mini pill showing which reactions that person gave; a chevron opens a 'Boosted/Liked by…' modal (verified live). Mentions render as white cards with orange (#ff8c00) border and glow; private mentions add a diagonal striped yellow texture and a 'PRIVATE MENTION' label. Day headings 'Today Tuesday' with lighter weekday suffix. Announcement is a pill disclosure. Settings icon opens a 'Notifications settings' modal with Accept/Filter selects per source (not in capture). Floating blue round Compose button bottom-right. A hidden Home timeline column exists in the DOM behind the notifications view (zero-height boxes). Page body scrolls inside a panel; ~343px out of view including the Show more… button."
